{{#> base title="Your account is already here" eyebrow="YOUR REDOVA ACCOUNT" preheader="You already have a REDOVA account. Sign in or recover access securely."}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Hello {{truncate name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0;">An account already exists for this email address. If you were trying to get started with REDOVA, you can sign in to your existing account.</p>
{{> button url=signInUrl label="Sign in to REDOVA"}}
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;">Forgot your password? <a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="color:#C8102E;text-decoration:underline;">Reset it securely</a>.</p>
{{> notice label="Wasn't you?" message="You can ignore this message. This sign-up attempt has not changed your existing account."}}
{{/base}}
